  -- — annihilators in M_d(R) are generated by idempotents (the
  -- complementary projection to the column-span of S).  Standard
  -- linear algebra.
  -- Ref: [kassel1995] https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4612-0783-2 §I
  -- — direct sum decomposition of finite-dimensional modules.
